      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuambira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muambire Aruni, anae na atu osi a Iziraeli uambe, Mwenyezi Mlungu walagiza hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi kahi ya Aiziraeli achitsindza ngʼombe, ngʼondzi au mbuzi ndani au kondze ya kambi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bila kumreha nyama hiye phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano, ili amulavye dza sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu mbere ya hema ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, mutu hiye andakala na kosa ra kuolaga naye ni atengbwe na atue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lagizo hiri rinalazimisha Aiziraeli kumrehera Mwenyezi Mlungu nyama ambao anaatsindza weruni. Andareha nyama hara kpwa mlavyadzi-sadaka phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano, nao andatsindza na kumlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu sadaka za amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, mlavyadzi-sadaka andamwagira-mwagira milatso phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha Mwenyezi Mlungu kahi za phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano, na kuocha gara marunya gakale kungu nono imuhamirayo Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Aiziraeli andakoma kabisa kulavira sadaka vizuka vyenye umbo ra ndenje, dzambo ambaro rikaahenda akose kukala aaminifu kpwangu. Hiri ni lagizo ra kare na kare kpwao na vivyazi vyao vyosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aambire kukala Muiziraeli yeyesi au mjeni asagalaye kahi yao, ndiyelavya sadaka ya kuochwa au sadaka yanjina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela asiirehe phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano ili kumlavira Mwenyezi Mlungu, mutu hiye andatengbwa na atue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
